OL,3,AWhy Tesla has been caught up in a
OL,4,Amassive car recall in China
OL,5,
OL,6,FHidden car door handles - the sleek
OL,7,Fdesigns often found on electric
OL,8,Fvehicles (EVs) - have come under the
OL,9,Fspotlight over the past week.
OL,11,FThat's after China announced its
OL,12,Fbiggest ever recall of cars, with more
OL,13,Fthan four million vehicles - mostly
OL,14,FTeslas - affected.
OL,16,FThe recall comes ahead of new
OL,17,Fregulations in China, requiring cars to
OL,18,Fhave a mechanical release both on the
OL,19,Finside and outside of their doors.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
